s="life historical" data-project-entity="mpe-project-31873"><strong>Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed</strong><p>Ask an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.</p><div class="facts">Source stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded</div></div></div><section class="sec wrap"><div class="sh"><span class="no">i</span><h2 class="t">Overview</h2></div><div class="overview">Shiv Tapasya by Jet Build Developers in Borivali West offers premium 1 and 2 BHK apartments designed for a blissful and wholesome lifestyle. Enjoy seamless connectivity with nearby W.E. Highway, upcoming metro, Link Road, and S.V. Road, plus easy access to education, entertainment, wellness, and spiritual centers within 2.5 km. With modern amenities like a fitness center, meditation space, high-speed elevators, and secure parking, Shiv Tapasya combines luxury and comfort for a peaceful, happy living experience.</div></section><section class="sec wrap"><div class="sh"><span class="no">₹</span><h2 class="t">Price vs Locality</h2></div><div class="value"><div><div class="vn">₹30,681</div><div class="vt">/sqft · locality avg <b>₹40,000</b></div></div><span class="badge2 below">23% below avg</span></div></section><section class="sec wrap"><div class="sh"><span class="no">₹</span><h2 class="t">Borivali West — resale, rent &amp; yield</h2></div><div class="tmm-grid"><div class="tmm-t"><div class="tmm-l">Resale</div><div class="tmm-v">₹31,200<span>/sqft</span></div><div class="tmm-s">median · 29 listings</div></div><div class="tmm-t"><div class="tmm-l">Rent</div><div class="tmm-v">₹88.7<span>/sqft/mo</span></div><div class="tmm-s">2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo</div></div><div class="tmm-t"><div class="tmm-l">Gross yield</div><div class="tmm-v">3.4<span>%/yr</span></div><div class="tmm-s">rent vs resale value</div></div></div><p class="tmm-cmp">This project is quoted around <b>₹30,681/sqft</b> — <b>2% below</b> resale here.</p><p class="tmm-no